# Technology

- Stack: Next.js 16 (App Router), React 19, TypeScript 5, Tailwind CSS 4.
  `package.json` is the source of truth for the exact versions.

- Icons: `lucide-react` is the only icon library. Always use it through the
  existing `Icon` component (`components/ui/icon.tsx`, exported from
  `components/ui/index.ts`), picking only `name`, `variant` and `size`.
  Never add another icon library.

- Animations: use the Tailwind CSS built-in animation and transition
  utilities (`animate-*`, `transition-*`). Do not add an animation library
  (e.g. framer-motion) or custom keyframes without developer validation.
